        <body>
            <div xml:id="d404-a11">

                <pb facs="0642" n="572" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg572"/>

                <head>No. 11.</head>

                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">President</hi>: I desire to speak personally with
                    you, upon matters grave and very important to the country. As you are a decided
                    lover of it, I hope that you will not deny me an interview. I am ready to start
                    for your city, notwithstanding the molestations of my infirmities.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>MAXIMILIAN.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
